! Radial grid for 0.15 deg horizontal resolution: CZTR's density map (5 cells
! per H_p, 30 km floor; tools/grid/grid_mod.f90) with radial cells no taller
! than 2 x the horizontal spacing r dtheta. 141 cells to the photosphere (60
! below 0.96 R, 83 below 0.99 R); the deep cells 2.6-3.3 Mm instead of 11 Mm.
! make data/static_init_015a2.dat -> data/grid_015a2.dat, data/static_init_015a2.dat
! The base at P = 5.89e13, the static envelope's convection-zone base
! (0.7115 R): the default 6e13 (CZTR's grid) lies ~1 Mm deeper, in a thin
! radiative layer; a cell there (1.3 Mm cells) gives the 4th-order face
! derivative of s0 a spurious superadiabatic overshoot at face 2 and a
! +-4 Lsun MLT / numerical diffusion pair (output_studio/c197_m0).
&grid
  p_base = 5.89e13
  horiz_deg = 0.15, aspect = 2.0
/
